[heading]Version 0.4.10[/heading]

[list]
[*]Added a preventative stability improvement for reports of the game freezing when warping to a distant or unloaded trader.
[*]Reported freeze was not reproducible in my test environment, but the likely risky teleport path was changed.
[*]The mod now briefly prepares distant or unloaded destination areas before teleporting when needed.
[*]The mod avoids synchronous terrain-height lookup on unloaded chunks, reducing the chance of short freezes during trader travel.
[*]Fixed destination filtering so the trader you are currently talking to is not shown as a travel destination.
[/list]

[b]No save reset is required.[/b]
